  "question": {
    "text": "Assuming <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;to be the frequency of the electromagnetic wave corresponding to the first line in Balmer&nbsp;series, the frequency of the immediate next line is"
